<title>USA: Sioux City hogs up $0.75-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs up $0.75-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was moderately active. Compared with Tuesday, barrows and gilts were $0.75 to $1.00 higher. Top $53.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   220-270 lbs     53.50</p>
<p>		 270-280 lbs     53.00-53.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3   280-300 lbs     51.00-52.50</p>
<p>    US 3-4   300-330 lbs     49.00-52.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $2.00. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3     300-400 lbs     43.00</p>
<p>		   400-500 lbs     scarce</p>
<p>		   500-550 lbs     49.00</p>
<p>		   550-700 lbs     52.00</p>
</text>
